    {
      "id": "os-ch02-001",
      "stemEn": "The instructions executed by a processor are divided into two categories. One category is called privileged instructions, which are allowed to be used only by ().",
      "stemCn": "处理器执行的指令被分为两类，其中有一类称为特权指令，它只允许（）使用。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Target programs",
          "textCn": "目标程序"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Associated users",
          "textCn": "联机用户"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "Operators",
          "textCn": "操作员"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "Operating system",
          "textCn": "操作系统"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "D",
      "explanationCn": "特权指令涉及 I/O、状态切换、中断控制等核心资源操作，只能在核心态由操作系统执行，普通用户程序不能直接使用。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch02-002",
      "stemEn": "The interface provided by an operating system to programmers is ().",
      "stemCn": "操作系统提供给编程人员的接口是（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Library functions",
          "textCn": "库函数"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "System calls",
          "textCn": "系统调用"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "Subprograms",
          "textCn": "子程序"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "High-level languages",
          "textCn": "高级语言"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "B",
      "explanationCn": "系统调用是操作系统向程序员提供的编程接口，应用程序通过系统调用请求内核完成文件、进程、设备等系统服务。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch02-003",
      "stemEn": "After an interrupt occurs, the program that enters interrupt processing belongs to ().",
      "stemCn": "在中断发生后，进入中断处理的程序属于（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Neither an application program nor an operating system program",
          "textCn": "既不是应用程序，也不是操作系统程序"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Operating system program",
          "textCn": "操作系统程序"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "It may be an application program or an operating system program",
          "textCn": "可能是应用程序，也可能是操作系统程序"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "User program",
          "textCn": "用户程序"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "B",
      "explanationCn": "中断处理程序在核心态执行，属于操作系统内核的一部分，用于响应和处理硬件或软件中断。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch02-004",
      "stemEn": "Which of the following instructions must be executed in kernel mode?",
      "stemCn": "下列必须在核心态下执行的指令是（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Fetch data from memory",
          "textCn": "从内存中取数"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Write the result of an operation into memory",
          "textCn": "将运算结果装入内存"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "I/O operation",
          "textCn": "I/O 操作"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "Arithmetic operation",
          "textCn": "算术运算"
